    "detailed_description": "<strong> \u300aSpin &amp; Jump\u300b is a casual and strategic Rougelite game that combines slot machines with combat. </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/77eb95496d0e0d7e7e39077e70ec52da.poster.avif?t=1736158243\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/77eb95496d0e0d7e7e39077e70ec52da.webm?t=1736158243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/77eb95496d0e0d7e7e39077e70ec52da.mp4?t=1736158243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A game with a slot machine as its core, all actions are determined by the slot machine!<br>The character's next actions, the damage caused to monsters, and the loot obtained!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story background</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/e7694614390554f9fd3c9036d9d93d49.poster.avif?t=1736158243\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/e7694614390554f9fd3c9036d9d93d49.webm?t=1736158243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/e7694614390554f9fd3c9036d9d93d49.mp4?t=1736158243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The story will start from the protagonist's village, rescue the villagers and sister who were captured and missing by the Demon King's army, and meet various characters along the way!<br>Expand your base, add new optional characters, and experience a variety of different genres!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Events during the adventure</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/d79e45d292dffb801c379cc4aff35fb0.poster.avif?t=1736158243\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/d79e45d292dffb801c379cc4aff35fb0.webm?t=1736158243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/d79e45d292dffb801c379cc4aff35fb0.mp4?t=1736158243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>During the adventurous journey, you may also be chased by the BOSS.<br>But don\u2019t panic yet! Say... maybe you can pick up martial arts secrets while running away (?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2>Battles, shops, collection, and even enhancements are all determined by the results of gambling!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/c8a47f81858f201f62a02d306f1e28e1.poster.avif?t=1736158243\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/c8a47f81858f201f62a02d306f1e28e1.webm?t=1736158243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/c8a47f81858f201f62a02d306f1e28e1.mp4?t=1736158243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As long as you react quickly enough, you can turn the impossible into possible!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/ad8fa1d6790e8aa1a6aeb493b48044d2.poster.avif?t=1736158243\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/ad8fa1d6790e8aa1a6aeb493b48044d2.webm?t=1736158243\" t